{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00192",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.33,
      "end_seconds": 5.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Hi there, is it alright if I come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.65,
      "end_seconds": 10.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.52,
      "end_seconds": 17.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "I wanted to get a ring-shaped itchy patch looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.22,
      "end_seconds": 19.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.84,
      "end_seconds": 24.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "It's been going on for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.38,
      "end_seconds": 27.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.29,
      "end_seconds": 35.61,
      "duration_seconds": 7.32,
      "text": "It usually comes with scaly, peeling skin. So, the scaly, peeling skin? That's been for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.76,
      "end_seconds": 41.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Have you had a ring-shaped itchy patch before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.58,
      "end_seconds": 51.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "I had a similar thing a couple of years ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.12,
      "end_seconds": 54.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.89,
      "end_seconds": 59.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.29,
      "end_seconds": 63.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Any rash on the palms, pus or new partner?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.75,
      "end_seconds": 67.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.52,
      "end_seconds": 70.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.36,
      "end_seconds": 72.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.96,
      "end_seconds": 86.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.93,
      "end_seconds": 90.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.97,
      "end_seconds": 94.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just typing this up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.83,
      "end_seconds": 108.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.9,
      "text": "Good, where were we. What medicines do you take regularly? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.09,
      "end_seconds": 117.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Um, I'm on Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day. Candid cream. I take it twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.8,
      "end_seconds": 121.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.61,
      "end_seconds": 124.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.06,
      "end_seconds": 131.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.48,
      "end_seconds": 132.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "I have diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.99,
      "end_seconds": 137.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.51,
      "end_seconds": 139.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.89,
      "end_seconds": 160.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.3,
      "end_seconds": 164.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.78,
      "end_seconds": 169.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.13,
      "end_seconds": 173.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.49,
      "end_seconds": 187.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Skin between the toes is white and peeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.9,
      "end_seconds": 203.26,
      "duration_seconds": 13.36,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.23,
      "end_seconds": 213.85,
      "duration_seconds": 9.62,
      "text": "Hmm, yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.43,
      "end_seconds": 237.5,
      "duration_seconds": 22.07,
      "text": "Putting it all together, this looks most like a fungal skin infection. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. I'd also keep psoriasis in mind. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a ring-shaped itchy patch for about two weeks, and no pus or rash on the palms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.39,
      "end_seconds": 240.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.57,
      "end_seconds": 244.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.73,
      "end_seconds": 245.48,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.38,
      "end_seconds": 270.67,
      "duration_seconds": 10.29,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. I'd like to arrange a skin scraping for suspected fungal infection. I'm prescribing terbinafine cream, once a day, for two weeks. That's for fungal infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.0,
      "end_seconds": 273.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Okay, um, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.21,
      "end_seconds": 294.38,
      "duration_seconds": 19.17,
      "text": "Keep the area dry, wear loose cotton, and don't share towels. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.32,
      "end_seconds": 297.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Well, got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.1,
      "end_seconds": 306.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.72,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in three weeks. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.54,
      "end_seconds": 315.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.71,
      "text": "So, I take the terbinafine cream, once a day and come back in three weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.92,
      "end_seconds": 321.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.68,
      "end_seconds": 324.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Alright, thanks. Bye for now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.79,
      "end_seconds": 327.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}